{"step_index":178,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-18T18:21:40Z","content":"I have streamlined the DNC behavior to match your exact requirements:\n\n### What Was Updated:\n1. **No Registry Lookup or Pre-Filtering:** Newly scanned lead lists are **never blocked or pre-filtered**. Every lead on your scanned sheet enters the active dialing queue ready to be called.\n2. **Simple In-App Disposition Button:**\n   - The **\"Block / DNC\"** button in the Power Dialer HUD is an instant 1-tap outcome button.\n   - If a contact asks not to be called during a call, tapping **Block / DNC** marks *that specific lead* as `do_not_call` and immediately advances to the next contact without querying any external registries.\n3. **Clean Global Settings:** Removed all registry management overhead from [`SettingsScreen.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/screens/SettingsScreen.tsx). Settings is now strictly focused on:\n   - **Google Gemini API Key** (for multimodal sheet OCR)\n   - **Caller Signature** (for dynamic `{{my_name}}` in SMS templates)\n   - **Auto-Advance Countdown Pacing** (toggle on/off and customize seconds)\n\nYou can refresh your browser tab at `http://localhost:8081` to test the simplified flow!"}
